+
+- **Code actions prepare pending inherited source.** The first request in an unchanged child sees an unsaved parent signature edit or undo before background diagnostics finish.
+
+- **Generate inherited method overrides.** Choose an override from a named class declaration or anywhere in its members, body or comments, then review the proposed method. Concrete parent methods delegate with their original native contract; missing implementations use an explicit throwing placeholder. Contributed by PHP Workbench downstream.
 
